  "title": "Microsoft Outage Affects Global Users",
  "summary": "Microsoft has experienced a major outage that started Sunday evening, affecting both digital and disc-based game access and prices, as well as causing users to be unable to access their Outlook email through web or apps. According to the Verge All Posts report, Microsoft has acknowledged the issue from its Microsoft 365 Status account, stating that 'We've determined a portion of infrastructure is experiencing elevated load across multiple regions.'",
